# Throughline - server secrets. Copy to `.env` for local dev.
# Journal entries live in the browser; the server only calls the language model.
# On Vercel, set these under Project Settings > Environment Variables (never in the browser).


# --- LLM provider (pick ONE; priority is Nebius > Anthropic) ------
# 1) Nebius AI Studio (preferred) — OpenAI-compatible. Key from studio.nebius.com.
NEBIUS_API_KEY=
# NEBIUS_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507
# NEBIUS_BASE_URL=https://api.studio.nebius.com/v1/chat/completions

# 2) Anthropic — Claude Opus 4.8.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# --- Seed protection --------------------------------------------------------
# If set, the in-app "Load a demo life" button is disabled and /seed requires
# this token. Leave UNSET to allow seeding from the app during the demo.
# SEED_TOKEN=
